# ==============================================================================
# Rclone Backup Exclude Rules (exclude.txt)
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to exclude.txt (cp exclude.txt.sample exclude.txt) and customize.
# Changes in exclude.txt will take effect on the next backup run.

# === Logs & System Telemetry ===
**/*.log
**/logs/**
**/log/**
/var/log/**

# === Seafile Data Repositories (Optional - uncomment if backing up Seafile separately) ===
# **/seafile*/**

# === Python Virtual Environments & Packages ===
**/venv/**
**/.venv/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc

# === Node.js / JavaScript Dependencies ===
**/node_modules/**
**/.npm/**
**/.pnpm-store/**

# === Cache, Temporary & Swap Files ===
**/.cache/**
**/cache/**
**/Cache/**
**/tmp/**
**/temp/**
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.swp
**/*~

# === Application Caches (Can grow to tens of gigabytes) ===
**/Plex Media Server/Cache/**
**/jellyfin/cache/**
**/immich/upload/thumbs/**
**/immich/upload/encoded-video/**
